539:
The MySQL database was designed to guarantee the consistency of transactional flows. It groups the following main tables :
•  Users & Clients : management of identifiers (email, hashed password, role 'CLIENT' or 'ADMIN') and links to individual or company profiles ;
•  Vehicles : brand, model, category, daily rate, status, photographs ;
•  Reservations : start and end dates, driver option with/without, total amount, status ;
•  Services & Products : general catalog of the 6 business units with technical characteristics and pricing ;
•  Quotations : unique reference (e.g.: DMD-2026-XXXX), creation date, pre-tax/inclusive amount ;
•  Notifications : alerts sent to clients and administrators.

612:
The Web Back-Office is the control center of the company. It integrates :
•  Dashboard : performance charts, projected turnover, number of quotations and reservations in progress ;
•  Fleet and trading product management : addition of new vehicles, products, update of daily prices ;

