•  The Visitor / Client : consults the catalog, composes their multi-service cart on the Web, makes vehicle reservations on the Mobile application and downloads their PDF quotations ;
•  The Administrator : supervises all operations, manages the fleet, updates pricing and validates quotations ;
•  The System / REST API : applies business rules, controls availability and orchestrates notification distribution.
